              "markdown": "### DECISION BASELINE — PRE\n\nBefore you begin, complete this diagnostic. Be honest. No one will see this but you.\n\nEvery key metric in this workbook is coded as a Behaviour Evidence Indicator (BEI) — a forensic marker of behavioural change.",
