              "markdown": "### Investigation 5 of 9\n\n**MISSION**: Write the formula that explains your decision pattern.\n\n**YOU WILL PRODUCE**:\n● ☐ Personal Equation\n● ☐ Falsification test\n\n**TIME**: 10 minutes\n**DIFFICULTY**: 🔴 Identity Shift\n\n---\n\n### 🧠 Think\n\nYour Personal Equation\n\nWrite your decision pattern as a diagnostic formula:\n\nEmotion + Perceived Options = Decision\nEmotion + Hidden Options = Better Decision",
